    "title": "East Texas veterans return home after emotional Brookshire Heroes Flight - NewsBreak",
    "text": "4 hours ago TYLER, Texas — Veterans are back home following the Brookshire Heroes Flight. After three days in Washington D.C., the group of East Texas veterans were welcomed back home with cheers, hugs and signs at Tyler Pounds Regional Airport. The group represented a wide range of service eras, from World War II and the Korean War to Vietnam, the Gulf War, Afghanistan and Iraq. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
